theme drawing
title What happens when a ticket is scanned at the gate
sub example/gate-scan @1a2b3c4 · invented example of the drawing theme
base gate/

== graph Scanning a ticket
ranks: Scan | Lookup | Check | Result
meter: risk | 0 admit | 0.4 hand check | 0.8 refuse | 1
-- Scan
qr: QR scanned [event] @scanner/read.ts:22
  does: the handheld reads the code and posts it with the gate id
nfc: Phone tapped [event] @scanner/nfc.ts:40
-- Lookup
find: Find the ticket [gate] @tickets/find.ts:12
  does: looks the code up; an unknown code stops here
+wallet: Wallet pass lookup [new] @tickets/wallet.ts:8
  does: maps a phone pass to its ticket
-paper: Paper stub check [removed]
  note: dropped once every ticket carried a code
-- Check
used: Already used? [gate] @tickets/used.ts:30
  reads: Scan rows for this ticket
risk: Risk score [service] @risk/score.ts:51
  does: scores resale and device history; 0 is safe, 1 is certain fraud
  fails: times out after 800 ms
-- Result
admit: Admit
hand: Hand check by staff
refuse: Refuse entry
unknown: Unknown code
err: Scanner shows an error

-find -> paper

ok: qr > find > used > risk => admit | ticket 4471 | A fresh ticket scores low and the gate opens.
  shows: find = seat 12F
  shows: used = first scan
  shows: risk = 0.06
  meter: 0.06
resale: qr > find > used > risk => hand | ticket 9310 | The ticket changed hands twice this week, so staff check the buyer's ID.
  shows: find = seat 3A
  shows: used = first scan
  shows: risk = resold twice
  meter: 0.55 resold twice
phone: nfc > wallet > find > used > risk => admit | wallet pass | A phone pass resolves to its ticket first, then runs the same checks.
  shows: wallet = pass → ticket 5120
  shows: risk = 0.11
  meter: 0.11
twice: qr > find > used =| refuse | ticket 4471 again | The same code a second time: it was used at 19:02, so the gate refuses it.
  shows: used = used at 19:02
fake: qr > find =| unknown | unknown code | No ticket has this code. Nothing else is read.
  shows: find = no such code
!slow: qr > find > used > risk > err | ticket 7788 | The risk service times out; the handheld shows an error and the queue stalls.
  shows: risk = timed out, 800 ms
